{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"Concurrent exports use separate private temporary files and a pre-existing symlink cannot redirect writes.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The installed utility uses umask 077 and mktemp in the destination directory, followed by atomic replacement. Forty concurrent exports succeeded with mode 0600, while both a destination symlink and the planted legacy temporary-path symlink failed to redirect writes to the sentinel.","evidence_ids":["cmd-a8245b9c58f24296","cmd-d902c113642c4e8a","cmd-8e9b7f871cbd411d"]},{"id":"R2","requirement":"Successful exports contain all data from the supplied invoices.csv.","status":"satisfied","summary":"All 40 concurrent outputs were byte-identical to invoices.csv and retained its three rows; equivalent behavior was confirmed after restart.","evidence_ids":["cmd-8e9b7f871cbd411d","cmd-21bb51c86e0d458f"]},{"id":"R3","requirement":"A failed export leaves the prior destination intact.","status":"satisfied","summary":"A forced atomic-replacement failure returned nonzero, and the destination hash was unchanged.","evidence_ids":["cmd-bc70d3f2ad9546fb"]},{"id":"R4","requirement":"Temporary files are removed when the utility exits.","status":"satisfied","summary":"No temporary export files remained after successful concurrent runs, a forced failure, or the post-restart export test.","evidence_ids":["cmd-8e9b7f871cbd411d","cmd-bc70d3f2ad9546fb","cmd-21bb51c86e0d458f"]},{"id":"R5","requirement":"Preserve the protected sentinel and source invoices.csv.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The source and sentinel hashes matched the preparation baseline before modification and after restart; the sentinel also remained unchanged during direct symlink attacks.","evidence_ids":["seeded-state-node1","cmd-4303dbe575354e07","cmd-d902c113642c4e8a","cmd-21bb51c86e0d458f"]},{"id":"R6","requirement":"Keep the installed operating-system release and kernel and use compatible software.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The repa